704
00:44:34.042 --> 00:44:35.333
No...

705
00:44:35.667 --> 00:44:36.833
Jerry, don't...

706
00:44:36.958 --> 00:44:39.000
I am yours... only yours.

707
00:44:39.083 --> 00:44:41.333
